{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-04T10:22:39.779Z","data":{"text":"All acceptance lines are implemented and verified.\n\nSummary:\n- Added `packages/ui/src/change/actions-client.ts` (`createActionClient`) and re-exported the web-action types from `contracts.ts`.\n- Added `ChangeActions` (props-only buttons, reject reason gating, retry labels, manual commands, pending + result including `Next:`) and `ChangeActionsPanel` (loads on mount/`asOf`, runs a tap, reloads).\n- Threaded an optional `actionClient` through `ChangeView`/`App`, and `main.tsx` only builds one over `window.fetch` when not a static export.\n- Moved the new styles to `change/actions.css` to respect the 250-line UI budget; `styles.css` is back to its original 194 lines.\n- Added `tests/ui-actions.test.tsx` covering static rendering, the client's requests/409, and an end-to-end approve through a real `startWebServer` (exit 0, and `approve` gone on the next load).\n\nBoth verify commands pass: task verify (10/10) and `pnpm verify` (exit 0). Result written to `openspec/changes/146-web-write-actions/.run/results/3.md`."}}
